{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "The one list of config.toml fields and how the GUI covers each. main.js reads it to validate and write, the renderer renders every control:auto entry from it, and tests/test_config_field_coverage.py reddens when emrg/config.py grows a field this file does not name. default values are compared against the dataclass (not restated by hand): a drift fails that test.",
